{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～虽然听说在这附近经常能看到……」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4891", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是它并不会那么轻易地出现啊」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进入2月以后，\\n纱凪家附近好像也有不可思议的生物的目击证言。", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "进入2月以后，纱凪家附近好像也有不可思议的生物的目击证言。", "plain_idx": 145, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "基于这些信息，今天我们出来寻找熊喵一族。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话虽如此，要是能简简单单找到就不必这么辛苦了。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近理央好像也会在晚上\\n　偷偷溜出来找，真让人担心」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": "「最近理央好像也会在晚上　偷偷溜出来找，真让人担心」", "plain_idx": 149, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4892", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「眼睛闪闪发光的，\\n　说是想找个新的跟班什么的」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": "「眼睛闪闪发光的，　说是想找个新的跟班什么的」", "plain_idx": 152, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4893", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过他能喜欢上动物真是太好了」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那倒是。要是能顺便\\n　对姐姐再温柔一点就更好了……」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "「那倒是。要是能顺便　对姐姐再温柔一点就更好了……」", "plain_idx": 156, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4894", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪虽然嘟囔着，\\n看上去却是很高兴的样子。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "纱凪虽然嘟囔着，看上去却是很高兴的样子。", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就由我来温柔地对待他的姐姐吧」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再、再这么温柔我也会很困扰的」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4895", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你太惯着我了。\\n　要是不偶尔放着我不管的话，\\n　可是会被认定为笨蛋情侣的哦」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "「新吾你太惯着我了。　要是不偶尔放着我不管的话，　可是会被认定为笨蛋情侣的哦」", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4896", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可不会放下纱凪不管哦」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你不管我，我也会跟着你的，所以没关系啦」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4897", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有点想见识一下\\n　冷淡的新吾呢」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": "「我也有点想见识一下　冷淡的新吾呢」", "plain_idx": 170, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4898", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『都这个点了，你打算去哪里啊？』", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4899", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『和你没关系 』", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『今天不是说好了要一直在一起的吗！』", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4900", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我改主意了』", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……又要去找别的女人吗？』", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4901", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『…………』", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『是去找那个叫美羽的女人吗？\\n　她就真的有这么好吗？！』", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "『是去找那个叫美羽的女人吗？　她就真的有这么好吗？！』", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4902", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『你别废话，\\n　老老实实在这里等着就行了』", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "『你别废话，　老老实实在这里等着就行了』", "plain_idx": 185, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『反正你也离不开我吧？』", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『？！』", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4903", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『等我有心情了再来找你』", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『什，什么时候才有心情？』", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4904", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那还用问吗』", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『当然是等我想要你的时候了——』", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "『当然是等我想要你的时候了——』", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4905", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？突然战战兢兢的……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没、没什么。只是稍微想象了一下……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4906", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………我这到底算是什么爱好呢」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4907", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪双手交叉，把头靠了过来。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……身材娇小的女孩子真可爱啊。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真想从身后紧紧抱住她不放手。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，说起来马上就到情人节了」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4908", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还没有亲手做过巧克力呢」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4909", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有送过家人巧克力吗？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给理央的都是我在店里随便买的」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4910", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是今年这样可不行啊」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4911", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "快到情人节了，\\n班里的氛围也变了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "快到情人节了，班里的氛围也变了。", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为男生，不由自主地会对这个节日产生关注。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "作为男生，不由自主地会对这个节日产生关注。", "plain_idx": 215, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼哼～喂，想不想要我亲手做的巧克力？\\n　超级甜的那种」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「哼哼～喂，想不想要我亲手做的巧克力？　超级甜的那种」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4912", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「超级甜的？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「超级甜哦。毕竟是给新吾的巧克力嘛♪」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4913", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对日益可爱的纱凪，\\n我事到如今反而害羞起来了。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "面对日益可爱的纱凪，我事到如今反而害羞起来了。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？怎么抓起脸来了？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4914", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没、没事」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「痒的话，我来帮你挠吧？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4915", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，等下」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4916", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，从刚才开始你的胸就一直碰到了我的手……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4917", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没、没关系！\\n　我才是，总觉得有点对不起」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「没、没关系！　我才是，总觉得有点对不起」", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们就这样互相抓起了对方的脸。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也是，抱歉只有B罩杯」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4918", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，\\n　稍微再找找熊喵的伙伴吧」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「总之，　稍微再找找熊喵的伙伴吧」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是啊。这才是本来的目的啊！」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4919", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4920", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沉默过后，\\n纱凪再次抱着我的胳膊蹭了过来。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "沉默过后，纱凪再次抱着我的胳膊蹭了过来。", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但是贴在一起的话，自然而然就会碰到嘛」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4921", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说也是」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一直这么贴着的话能习惯吗？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4922", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，那个……可能有点难……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在习惯之前，我那辛辛苦苦保持到现在的\\n理性可能就要灰飞烟灭了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "在习惯之前，我那辛辛苦苦保持到现在的理性可能就要灰飞烟灭了。", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不如说这种事一辈子都习惯不了的吧。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要自己还喜欢纱凪喜欢得不得了的话。\\n换句话说，未来也几乎可以肯定是习惯不了的。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "只要自己还喜欢纱凪喜欢得不得了的话。换句话说，未来也几乎可以肯定是习惯不了的。", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这种小而有料的突起，\\n身为一个男人没有点反应是不可能的——", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "对于这种小而有料的突起，身为一个男人没有点反应是不可能的——", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4923", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～～～！」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿，看到这么害羞的新吾，\\n　我也兴奋起来了♪」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「嘿嘿，看到这么害羞的新吾，　我也兴奋起来了♪」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4924", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「汝也真是个可爱的家伙啊～」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4925", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这句话，我真想强烈地回应她。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
